ult":false,"description":"Yugabyte SQL (YSQL)"},{"id":2156857038,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTU2ODU3MDM4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/area/ycql","name":"area/ycql","color":"0c4fcc","default":false,"description":"Yugabyte CQL (YCQL)"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"OlegLoginov","id":31254529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjU0NTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31254529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegLoginov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"OlegLoginov","id":31254529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjU0NTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31254529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegLoginov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2020-11-02T12:33:45Z","updated_at":"2020-11-06T15:39:49Z","closed_at":"2020-11-06T15:39:49Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The issue happens only in case when the table is being restored on the same (original) cluster, where it was backed up.\r\n\r\nThe scenario:\r\n1. Create the table backup. (At this moment the table has SCHEMA-1.)\r\n2. Alter the table. (From the moment the table has SCHEMA-2.)\r\n3. Restore the table from the backup on the same cluster.\r\nExpected schema after the restoring:  SCHEMA-1, but it has SCHEMA-2 due to a bug.\r\n\r\nReason: table is not recreated by the backup-restore procedure if there is existing table with ID as in the backup, + the keyspace and table names must be the same, + the table must be running. \r\n\r\nFix idea: If the backed up table is found by ID - additionally we need to compare the table schema. If the table schema was changed - the backup-restore must fail.\r\n\r\nThe issue can affect both - YCQL & YSQL.\r\n\r\nWorkaround: manually drop the table before restoring.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"OlegLoginov","id":31254529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjU0NTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31254529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegLoginov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6245/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6245/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}